#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:478
msgctxt "Route119_Text_MayIntro"
msgid ""
"MAY: {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"Where were you? I was looking for you!\p"
"How much stronger have you gotten?\n"
"Let me check for you!\p"
"Ready with your POKéMON?\n"
"Of course you are! Go!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"你跑到哪里去了？我一直在找你！\p"
"你变强了多少呢？让我来检验一下！\p"
"宝可梦准备好了吗？\n"
"当然准备好了吧！上吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:486
msgctxt "Route119_Text_MayDefeat"
msgid ""
"Achah!\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, you're strong!\p"
"I was worried that you might be\n"
"struggling with your training.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀！{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好强！\p"
"我还担心你修行得不顺利呢。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:492
msgctxt "Route119_Text_MayPresentForYou"
msgid ""
"MAY: But I had absolutely nothing to\n"
"worry about! Keep it up!\p"
"And, here! I have a present for you.$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：不过我完全是白担心了！\n"
"继续加油吧！\p"
"还有，给！我有礼物要送给你。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:497
msgctxt "Route119_Text_MayExplainFly"
msgid ""
"MAY: Use FLY, and your POKéMON will\n"
"instantly carry you to any town you've\l"
"already visited.\p"
"But, to use FLY, you have to get\n"
"the GYM BADGE from FORTREE CITY.\l"
"That's important, so don't forget.\p"
"You should FLY home and visit\n"
"LITTLEROOT for a change.\p"
"I bet your mom's worried about you,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"Well, let's meet again somewhere!$"
msgstr ""
"小遥：使用飞翔，你的宝可梦就\n"
"能一下子把你带到去过的任何城镇。\p"
"不过，要使用飞翔，就得拿到茵郁市的\n"
"道馆徽章。这很重要，可别忘了。\p"
"你也该飞回家，回未白镇看看了。\p"
"我猜你妈妈一定很担心你，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"好了，我们在什么地方再见吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:510
msgctxt "Route119_Text_BrendanIntro"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: {PLAYER}! So this is where\n"
"you've been looking for POKéMON?\p"
"Let me see how good you got.\n"
"I'll test you!\p"
"Now!\n"
"It's a battle, so battle!$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：{PLAYER}！\n"
"原来你一直在这里找宝可梦啊？\p"
"让我看看你变得有多厉害。我来考考你！\p"
"好了！既然是对战，那就来对战吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:518
msgctxt "Route119_Text_BrendanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"You've gotten pretty darn decent.$"
msgstr "嗯……你变得相当厉害了嘛。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:522
msgctxt "Route119_Text_BrendanIllGiveYouThis"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I'd say you're good enough\n"
"to search for POKéMON anywhere.\p"
"Here, I'll give you this.\n"
"Try it out.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：我觉得你已经有能力\n"
"去任何地方找宝可梦了。\p"
"给，这个送给你。试试看吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:528
msgctxt "Route119_Text_BrendanExplainFly"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Use FLY, and your POKéMON\n"
"instantly carries you to any town\l"
"you've already visited.\p"
"But you need the FORTREE GYM BADGE \n"
"to do that.\p"
"Anyway, I have to move along.$"
msgstr ""
"小悠：使用飞翔，你的宝可梦就\n"
"能一下子把你带到去过的任何城镇。\p"
"不过要做到这一点，\n"
"你需要茵郁道馆的徽章。\p"
"总之，我得走了。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:536
msgctxt "Route119_Text_ScottWayToGoBeSeeingYou"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: Hahahah!\n"
"Way to go, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"I just passed by a TRAINER riding\n"
"a BIKE.\p"
"You just beat that TRAINER, didn't you?\n"
"It was pretty obvious that you did.\p"
"The kid looked really upset with\n"
"a face all red from anger.\p"
"I sure seem to run into you often.\n"
"Are you off to FORTREE GYM next?\p"
"I expect that you'll do well at the GYM.\n"
"Well, I'll be seeing you!$"
msgstr ""
"亚希达：哈哈哈！干得漂亮，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"我刚刚和一个骑自行车的\n"
"训练家擦肩而过。\p"
"你刚才打败了那个训练家吧？\n"
"一看就知道。\p"
"那孩子气得满脸通红，看起来很不甘心。\p"
"我好像经常碰到你呢。\n"
"你接下来要去茵郁道馆吗？\p"
"我相信你在道馆里一定会有好的表现。\n"
"那么，回头见！$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:551
msgctxt "Route119_Text_ScottYouWonAtFortreeGym"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Beep!\p"
"SCOTT: Hiya, {PLAYER}{KUN}, it's me!\p"
"Just as I thought, you won at\n"
"the FORTREE GYM.\p"
"Your strength…\n"
"Perhaps you really are the TRAINER\l"
"that I've been searching for.\p"
"Remember, you have a fan in me.\n"
"I'll be cheering from the sidelines.\l"
"Keep up the great work!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … Click!$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… 哔！\p"
"亚希达：嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}，是我！\p"
"果然不出我所料，你在茵郁道馆赢了。\p"
"你的实力……也许你真的就\n"
"是我一直在寻找的训练家。\p"
"记住，我是你的粉丝哦。\n"
"我会在场外为你加油的。继续努力吧！\p"
"…… …… …… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… 咔嚓！$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:566
msgctxt "Route119_Text_StayAwayFromWeatherInstitute"
msgid ""
"We're standing lookout here.\p"
"Hey, you! Stay away from the WEATHER\n"
"INSTITUTE. It's not safe.$"
msgstr ""
"我们在这里放哨。\p"
"喂，你！离天气研究所远一点。\n"
"那里很危险。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:571
msgctxt "Route119_Text_DontGoNearWeatherInstitute"
msgid ""
"Lookout duty is surprisingly boring.\p"
"Hey, you! Please don't go near the\n"
"WEATHER INSTITUTE.$"
msgstr ""
"放哨的工作意外地无聊啊。\p"
"喂，你！请不要靠近天气研究所。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:576
msgctxt "Route119_Text_ThoughtFlyByCatchingBirdMons"
msgid ""
"I thought you FLY by catching a whole\n"
"flock of BIRD POKéMON, and then\l"
"hanging on to them somehow.\p"
"But it turns out there's an HM move\n"
"called FLY!\p"
"I wish I'd known about that a long\n"
"time ago…$"
msgstr ""
"我还以为“飞翔”是要抓一大群鸟宝可\n"
"梦，然后想办法抓住它们飞起来呢。\p"
"结果原来是有一个叫飞翔的秘传招式！\p"
"要是我早点知道就好了……$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:585
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TallGrassSnaresBikeTires"
msgid ""
"Tch…\n"
"It's a no-go…\p"
"The tall grass snares BIKE tires.\n"
"There's no way you can cycle here.$"
msgstr ""
"啧……不行……\p"
"高高的草会缠住自行车的轮胎。\n"
"在这里根本没法骑车。$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:591
msgctxt "Route119_Text_CanYourMonMakeSecretBase"
msgid ""
"Can your POKéMON use its SECRET POWER\n"
"on a big pile of grass and make a\l"
"SECRET BASE?$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦能对一大丛草使用秘密之力，\n"
"做出秘密基地吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:596
msgctxt "Route119_Text_RouteSignFortree"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 119\n"
"{RIGHT_ARROW} FORTREE CITY$"
msgstr ""
"119号道路\n"
"{RIGHT_ARROW} 茵郁市$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:600
msgctxt "Route119_Text_WeatherInstitute"
msgid "WEATHER INSTITUTE$"
msgstr "天气研究所$"

#: data/maps/Route119/scripts.inc:603
msgctxt "Route119_Text_TrainerTipsDecoration"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"Up to sixteen decorations and\n"
"furniture items can be placed in\l"
"a SECRET BASE.\p"
"Pick your favorite items and create\n"
"your very own SECRET BASE exactly the\l"
"way you want.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小知识\p"
"秘密基地里最多可以摆\n"
"放16件装饰品和家具。\p"
"挑选你喜欢的物品，打造一个完\n"
"全符合你心意的秘密基地吧。$"
